## CodeInput.razor

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Components.Shared`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`
**Location**: `Components/Shared/CodeInput.razor`

### Purpose
Blazor shared component wrapping BlazorMonaco's `StandaloneCodeEditor` for code input. Provides syntax highlighting, dark theme (vs-dark), automatic layout, and two-way value binding.

### Component Markup
```razor
@using BlazorMonaco
@using BlazorMonaco.Editor
@using BlazorMonaco.Languages

<div class="monaco-input">
    <StandaloneCodeEditor @ref="_code" Id="@_id" 
        ConstructionOptions="EditorConstructionOptions" 
        OnDidChangeModelContent="OnModelContentChanged" />
</div>
```

### Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `Value` | `string?` | `null` | Current editor content (two-way bindable) |
| `ValueChanged` | `EventCallback<string>` | — | Fires when content changes |
| `Language` | `string` | `"plaintext"` | Monaco language mode for syntax highlighting |

### Code-Behind

```csharp
@code {
    private string _id { get; set; } = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();
    private StandaloneCodeEditor _code = default!;

    [Parameter] public string? Value { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<string> ValueChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string Language { get; set; } = "plaintext";

    private StandaloneEditorConstructionOptions EditorConstructionOptions(StandaloneCodeEditor editor)
    {
        return new StandaloneEditorConstructionOptions
        {
            AutomaticLayout = true,
            Language = Language,
            Value = Value,
            Theme = "vs-dark"
        };
    }

    private async Task OnModelContentChanged(ModelContentChangedEvent e)
    {
        Value = await _code.GetValue();
        await ValueChanged.InvokeAsync(Value);
    }
}
```

### Editor Configuration
- **Theme**: `vs-dark` (dark theme)
- **AutomaticLayout**: `true` (resizes with container)
- **Language**: Determined by `Language` parameter
- **Initial Value**: Set from `Value` parameter

### Two-Way Binding
The component supports `@bind-Value` pattern:
```razor
<CodeInput @bind-Value="myCode" Language="csharp" />
```

Content changes trigger `OnDidChangeModelContent` → `GetValue()` → `ValueChanged` callback.

### Dependencies
- `BlazorMonaco` NuGet package
- `BlazorMonaco.Editor.StandaloneCodeEditor`
- `BlazorMonaco.Languages` (for language support)

### Related
- `CodeLanguages` - File extension to language mapper
- `BlazorMonaco` - Monaco editor wrapper for Blazor
